    "id": "1945:10484",
    "name": "Toolbar internal / Android / FAB",
    "description": "Floating action buttons (FABs) help people take primary actions on a screen. The FAB appears in front of all other content on screen, and is recognizable for its rounded shape and icon in the center. Medium FABs are recommended to use as the default FAB site.\n\n\nUse a FAB for the most common or important action on a screen\nMake sure the icon in a FAB is clear and understandable\nFABs persist on the screen when content is scrolling",
